# Bundle reverse-engineering outputs
# COMMIT the human-readable artefacts (so company agent without HAR can read):
#   - decompiled/modules/deobfuscated.js  (945 KB Vue source, grep-able)
#   - routes-generated/*.merged.shapes.md (60 KB endpoint preview catalogue)
# SKIP the large raw artefacts (regenerable from `npm run reverse`):
decompiled/app/
decompiled/**/node_modules/
decompiled/**/bundle.json
routes-generated/*.merged.endpoints.json
routes-generated/*.merged.js
captures/*.har
tf-call-log-*.json
*.bak-*
